        "target": "Given: \n- 4 friends\n- 50% off on all items\n- Original price of a t-shirt = $20\n- Each friend buys one t-shirt\n\nFirst, calculate the discounted price of one t-shirt:\n- 50% off means the t-shirt is now 50% of the original price\n- 50% of $20 = 0.50 * $20 = $10\n\nNow, calculate the total amount spent by all four friends:\n- Each friend spends $10\n- 4 friends * $10 = $40\n\nSo, the total amount spent by the four friends is $40.\n\nFINAL: 40",
